  "decision_conditions": [
    "The application site falls within Bush Hill Park Conservation Area.  The proposed side extensions would extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse on article 2(3) land and are Not permitted development.  The proposed single storey rear extension has an eaves height of more than 3m within 2m of the boundary of the curtilage of the dwellinghouse and works do NOT constitute Permitted Development under Article 3 and Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A, A.1 (i) and A.2 (b) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "The application site falls within Bush Hill Park Conservation Area.  The proposed roof extension is to a dwellinghouse on article 2(3) land.  Also the proposed dormer when added to the non-original roof structure in total (i.e. dormer plus existing roof) would exceed 50 cubic metres and does NOT constitute Permitted Development under Article 3 and Schedule 2, Part 1, Class B, B.1 (d)(ii) and (f) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended).",
    "The proposed front porch exceeds 3m in height and does NOT constitute Permitted Development under Article 3 and Schedule 2, Part 1, Class D, D.1 (c) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\r"
  ],
